Package: unim
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: im-config
Description: Korean Input Method Engine
 UNIM is a modular Korean Input Method Engine.
 This package contains the core daemon, C-API library, CLI tools,
 and XIM/Wayland protocol support.

Package: unim-indicator
Architecture: amd64
Depends: unim (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libappindicator3-1
Description: UNIM Status Indicator (non-GNOME)
 System tray status indicator for UNIM in non-GNOME desktop environments.
 Uses StatusNotifierItem (SNI) protocol for tray integration.
 Not needed if using GNOME Shell Extension.

Package: unim-gtk
Architecture: amd64
Depends: unim (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Korean Input Method Engine (GTK modules)
 GTK3 and GTK4 input method modules for UNIM.
 Includes GTK settings tool.

Package: unim-qt
Architecture: amd64
Depends: unim (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Korean Input Method Engine (Qt plugins)
 Qt5 and Qt6 platform input context plugins for UNIM.
 Includes Qt settings tool.

Package: gnome-shell-extension-unim
Architecture: all
Depends: unim (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}, gnome-shell
Description: UNIM GNOME Shell Extension
 GNOME Shell extension for UNIM, providing native integration and hotkeys.
